    "body": "It turned out that we did not include the external timer in `tp_traverse`, and the external timer could be a container that causes a ref cycle - this could lead to ref leak.\r\n\r\nConfirmed that `./python -m test -R3:3 test_cprofile` passed after the change.\n\n<!-- gh-issue-number: gh-120289 -->\n* Issue: gh-120289\n<!-- /gh-issue-number -->\n",
